        "body": "In June 1944, the Red Army launched a major offensive against Finland while Germany was collapsing elsewhere. Soviet artillery, armor, and air power smashed through forward positions on the Karelian Isthmus, forcing a rapid Finnish retreat.\n\nFinland Seeks Weapons and Time: Finland urgently requested German anti-tank weapons, aircraft support, and ammunition. The crisis forced Finnish leaders to balance the need for German help with the growing need to exit the war before Soviet terms became worse.",
